  <text id="title" x="86" y="50" width="470" height="40" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">What the platform really is</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="86" y="108" width="1020" height="82" font="body" size="20" color="muted" line-height="1.38"><p>This is not only a permit dashboard. It is a Nigeria-ready operating platform that connects land, permits, evidence, field operations, AI, and audit trust across public and market workflows.</p></text>

